title: "Finbot: From Payment Ambiguity to Evidence-Grounded Answers"
abstract: >-
  Code, synthetic data, evaluation scripts, saved results and demo for an inspectable,
  read-only payment-support assistant: scored clarification with explicit record
  confirmation, evidence-checked answers with repair, record-built fallback or refusal,
  and an evidence inspector.
